<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9200" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνολολύζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry aloud, shout aloud,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνωλόλυξα χαρᾶς ὕπο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					587
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				148.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				205
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1173
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>bewail loudly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				750
			</span></i>: but c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>excite by Bacchic cries,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρώτας δὲ Θήβας . . ἀνωλόλυξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
